{
  "_comment": [
    "Scenario: UC-02 monotonous night highway drive intended to fire the",
    "aica_transparent_hybrid_trigger_v1 package's MONOTONY_PROPOSAL (not",
    "REST_PROPOSAL). Feature 020 (merged simulator), Slice-3.",
    "",
    "Recipe (see docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-18-merged-simulator-slice3-monotony.md):",
    "a long uninterrupted highway route (>=60 continuous minutes before the",
    "single required rest facility, placed EARLY so it never re-enters the",
    "'nextRestSpotMin' window once passed), is_night=true + familiar_route=true",
    "(both feed monotony_prevention_score directly), a short intermittent",
    "traffic jam early on (pushes env_load, shared by monotony_prevention_score",
    "AND base_safety_risk, but only 0.10-weighted in the latter), and",
    "driver_signal_params tuned for SLOW drowsiness/fatigue growth so",
    "base_safety_risk stays far below minimum_risk_for_rest_bonus (0.45) and",
    "threshold_suggest (0.7) for the whole run -- REST never wins priority.",
    "allowed_actions includes decline (+ acknowledge) so MONOTONY_PROPOSAL is",
    "actionable and pauses the run like REST does."
  ],
